stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Intake: Brief received
  Intake --> Scored: BriefScore preflight
  Scored --> Generating: /api/generate started
  Generating --> Failed: Stream/validation/provider error
  Failed --> Generating: Retry generation

  Generating --> Complete: v1 saved in S3 + metadata in MongoDB
  Complete --> Negotiating: Chat refinements / scope changes
  Negotiating --> Complete: Section mutation saved as vN+1

  Complete --> Shared: Portal link created (token/PIN/expiry)
  Shared --> Negotiating: Client asks for revisions
  Shared --> Won: Deal marked won
  Shared --> Lost: Deal marked lost

  Won --> [*]
  Lost --> [*]
